        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-10T23:20:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Bunston\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/48/1939_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Bunston:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I noticed that on the GtG toutube channel, they have the full gameplay videos that Chris Burten did under a playlist, but none of the videos appear in the \"Videos\" tab. I'm wondering if the video Eric did this morning has been uploaded already, but we can't see it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Looks like I forgot to change those videos from unlisted to public. I'll do that and upload the live stream on Monday!</p>",
